## My Top Three Types — Detailed Interpretation

### Type 1: E — Enterprising

**What this type typically values:**

The Enterprising type typically values leadership, decision-making, taking initiative and working toward goals. People with this interest often enjoy communicating with others, taking responsibility and influencing decisions.

**How this shows up in my life:**

I can see this type in my current career because I communicate and work with people across different areas of the business. I also enjoy taking on new responsibilities and working toward goals that can help me continue advancing professionally. In my SWOT Analysis, I identified communication and networking as strengths I have developed throughout my career.

**Careers associated with this type that interest me:**

1. Information Technology Project Manager
2. Computer & Information Systems Manager
3. Project Management Specialist

